# AppUpdate — the walker demo's per-frame update (#918 split of App for the
# 1000-line cap): frameBegin, the controlled character's position / heading
# reads, the clip switch and updateApp itself. App keeps createApp (the world
# and renderer setup) and runWalkerApp (the loop).
